  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"854d32d7-0690-284d-9dde-5c8be5d1efdf"],
 " ",
 "draws each array of the hypermatrix hm as cubes in space, in canonical \
order."
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"2caeabd8-fb32-6e41-8293-e1b5527a5b3b"],

